{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "pollution_monthly",
  "spec": ["pollution 4.9", "pollution 11.16"],
  "description": "Test 16: incinerated 1000, wte 0, landfilled 3000, one export deal of amount 1000, shipped costPerUnit 0.005 -> (1000 + 0 + 3000 + 1000) x 0.005 = 25 -> line item 20 full expenses := 25 (and lastMonthCost 25). Both deal lists get SetAmountUsed(0) (imports first). The month's counters move to last month, decomposedLastMonth := decomposed (123), then the counters, decomposed and exportCapacity are zeroed; history 0xEA110158 produced, 0x8AB2F258 imported, 0x6AB2F260 exported, 0xEA11016F recycled, 0xEA110197 incinerated, 0xEA1101A1 wte, 0xEA1101AA landfilled. Aging (4.9.3, funding 100 %, efficiency 1): an incinerator with used 500 of capacity 1000 -> ratio 0.5 -> usage decay curve 0.45 x funding decay curve(1.0) 1.0 x aging rate 10 -> condition 4.5 (< T1 5: no lot change); its used moves to last month (500) and used := 0. The next month the ratio is 0 -> curve 0.1 -> condition 5.5 >= T1 5 (< T2 20) -> lot condition 2 at the occupant's cell (11, 11). Waste-to-energy: output := used 250 x max output 40 / capacity 1000 = 10 (0x27812852), then last := 250, used := 0. The month ends with the effect refresh and one MarkDealsDirty.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "pollution_create"},
    {"op": "pollution_init"},
    {"op": "pollution_env", "deals": [{"deal": "exp", "type": "export", "amount": 1000, "used": 400},
      {"deal": "imp", "type": "import", "amount": 50, "used": 20}]},
    {"op": "pollution_occupant", "occupant": "inc", "tract": [5, 5],
